.SH "NAME"
streamline-find \- search Streamline icon collection
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.sp
\fBstreamline\-find\fP \fIQUERY...\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.sp
\fBstreamline\-find\fP searches through the Streamline icon collection and returns matching SVG pathnames with match rankings. Results are ordered by relevance score in descending order.
.sp
The tool uses a SQLite search index when available for fast searching. If no index is found, it falls back to filesystem search (consider running \fBstreamline\-index\fP(1) to build the search index for better performance).
.sp
The search supports multiple query types:
.sp
\fBFilename search\fP
.RS 4
Exact filename matches, prefix matches, and partial matches
.RE
.sp
\fBCategory search\fP
.RS 4
Search by main categories (plump, core, flex, sharp, ultimate, block, etc.)
.RE
.sp
\fBStyle search\fP
.RS 4
Search by visual styles (duo, flat, gradient, solid, etc.) for styled categories
.RE
.sp
\fBSubcategory search\fP
.RS 4
Search by functional subcategories (culture, arrows, interface\-essential, etc.)
.RE
.SH "OPTIONS"
.sp
\fB\-r, \-\-rank\fP
.RS 4
Print rank score along with each result.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-f, \-\-full\-path\fP
.RS 4
Print full absolute path instead of relative path from data directory.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-o, \-\-or\fP
.RS 4
Use OR logic instead of AND for multiple query terms.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-i, \-\-index =\fIFILE\fP\fP
.RS 4
Specify the index file to use (default: /var/lib/streamline\-vectors/index.db).
.RE
.sp
\fB\-d, \-\-data\-dir =\fIDIR\fP\fP
.RS 4
Specify the icon data directory to use (default: /usr/share/streamline\-vectors).
.RE
.sp
\fB\-q, \-\-quiet\fP
.RS 4
Decrease verbosity. Can be used multiple times.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fP
.RS 4
Increase verbosity. Can be used multiple times.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.RS 4
Show help message and exit.
.RE
.sp
\fB\-\-version\fP
.RS 4
Show version information and exit.
.RE
.sp
All other arguments are treated as search query terms. By default, multiple terms use AND logic (all terms must match). Use \fB\-o\fP/\fB\-\-or\fP for OR logic (any term must match).
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.sp
\fBSTREAMLINE_INDEX\fP
.RS 4
Path to the search index database (default: /var/lib/streamline\-vectors/index.db)
.RE
.sp
\fBSTREAMLINE_DATA_DIR\fP
.RS 4
Path to the icon data directory (default: /usr/share/streamline\-vectors)
.RE
.SH "EXAMPLES"
.sp
Search for arrows
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find arrow\fP
.RE
.sp
Search by category
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find plump\fP
.RE
.sp
Search by style
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find duo\fP
.RE
.sp
Search by subcategory
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find culture\fP
.RE
.sp
Search for specific icon
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find coffee\fP
.RE
.sp
Search for icons matching both "coffee" AND "bold" (default AND logic)
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find coffee bold\fP
.RE
.sp
Search for icons matching either "coffee" OR "bold" (OR logic)
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find \-o coffee bold\fP
.RE
.sp
Show ranking scores
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find \-r coffee\fP
.RE
.sp
Show full absolute paths
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find \-f coffee\fP
.RE
.sp
Use custom index file
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find \-i /path/to/custom/index.db coffee\fP
.RE
.sp
Use custom data directory
.RS 4
\fBstreamline\-find \-d /path/to/icons coffee\fP
.RE
.SH "FILES"
.sp
\fI/var/lib/streamline\-vectors/index.db\fP
.RS 4
SQLite search index (built by streamline\-index)
.RE
.sp
\fI/usr/share/streamline\-vectors/\fP
.RS 4
Icon data directory
.RE
